    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“这倒也是呵……”肯定是那么回事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"That is true enough...\" It must certainly be just that.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "沙子是决不会休息的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sand would never rest.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "男人茫然不知所措。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The man stood there blankly, at a complete loss.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "一个念头使他困惑，就像本来不以为然，若无其事地踩了一脚蛇的尾巴，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A thought bewildered him, as if he had carelessly stepped on a snake's tail, thinking nothing of it,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "谁知这蛇竟意外地大。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "only to discover that the snake was unexpectedly large.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00246",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "注意一看，蛇头竟然在自己的身后。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When he looked more closely, the snake's head was actually behind him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
